7. Vendoo offers paid subscription options that vary depending on how many items you want to cross-list. </Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">stepped_summary</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="102.1896"><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">11826577</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Post Text on Instagram</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Open Instagram. 
